steiner@math.bgsu.edu wrote:

> One more question: How do you fight a ghost?

It's much slower than you, so you can step in and hit and step back before
it even notices you.

Or lure it to the up stairs (if you're on your way down) and go up when
it's next to you, then lead it well away from the stairs so you can go
down without it next to you; this traps it on the level you've just left
until you've finished sorting through its bones pile, gone further down
and gained a few levels.

Enchanted weapons work a treat against ghosts.

(I've only ever been killed by ghosts when being assaulted by something
else at the same time, or fainting from hunger, or paralysed by an
injudicious hit at a floating eye)

